[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.268",
    "end": "00:00:05.903",
    "start_seconds": 4.268,
    "end_seconds": 5.903,
    "text": "You may have heard the phrase"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.936",
    "end": "00:00:09.440",
    "start_seconds": 5.936,
    "end_seconds": 9.44,
    "text": "\"in space, no one can hear you scream.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.473",
    "end": "00:00:10.875",
    "start_seconds": 9.473,
    "end_seconds": 10.875,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.908",
    "end": "00:00:13.077",
    "start_seconds": 10.908,
    "end_seconds": 13.077,
    "text": "But that's true only for human ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.878",
    "end": "00:00:18.482",
    "start_seconds": 13.878,
    "end_seconds": 18.482,
    "text": "The universe is filled with tenuous atmospheres of one kind or another,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.482",
    "end": "00:00:20.785",
    "start_seconds": 18.482,
    "end_seconds": 20.785,
    "text": "and through those atmospheres, pressure waves --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.818",
    "end": "00:00:22.920",
    "start_seconds": 20.818,
    "end_seconds": 22.92,
    "text": "sound -- moves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.953",
    "end": "00:00:27.591",
    "start_seconds": 22.953,
    "end_seconds": 27.591,
    "text": "Through stars, across galaxies, even between galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.992",
    "end": "00:00:29.226",
    "start_seconds": 27.992,
    "end_seconds": 29.226,
    "text": "One of the most wonderful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.260",
    "end": "00:00:32.196",
    "start_seconds": 29.26,
    "end_seconds": 32.196,
    "text": "and recently discovered examples of cosmic sound"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.229",
    "end": "00:00:36.434",
    "start_seconds": 32.229,
    "end_seconds": 36.434,
    "text": "is in the very young universe, shortly after the Big Bang."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.734",
    "end": "00:00:40.104",
    "start_seconds": 36.734,
    "end_seconds": 40.104,
    "text": "Now you may be wondering, how would we know that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.138",
    "end": "00:00:44.241",
    "start_seconds": 41.138,
    "end_seconds": 44.241,
    "text": "Well famously, as you look very far out into space,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.275",
    "end": "00:00:46.577",
    "start_seconds": 44.275,
    "end_seconds": 46.577,
    "text": "you also look back in time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.610",
    "end": "00:00:49.847",
    "start_seconds": 46.61,
    "end_seconds": 49.847,
    "text": "simply because it takes time for the light to get to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.614",
    "end": "00:00:55.619",
    "start_seconds": 50.614,
    "end_seconds": 55.619,
    "text": "Remarkably, if you look far enough past all the galaxies,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.653",
    "end": "00:00:59.523",
    "start_seconds": 55.653,
    "end_seconds": 59.523,
    "text": "you can see to a time before any galaxies had yet formed,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.557",
    "end": "00:01:04.862",
    "start_seconds": 59.557,
    "end_seconds": 64.862,
    "text": "even to a time when the universe itself had only just been born."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.830",
    "end": "00:01:08.699",
    "start_seconds": 65.83,
    "end_seconds": 68.699,
    "text": "So what do you see coming from this newborn universe?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.366",
    "end": "00:01:14.071",
    "start_seconds": 69.366,
    "end_seconds": 74.071,
    "text": "You see the light of the Big Bang's hot, glowing youth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.805",
    "end": "00:01:18.976",
    "start_seconds": 74.805,
    "end_seconds": 78.976,
    "text": "At that time, the universe was filled with an almost uniform,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.009",
    "end": "00:01:20.911",
    "start_seconds": 79.009,
    "end_seconds": 80.911,
    "text": "hot, glowing gas"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.911",
    "end": "00:01:25.349",
    "start_seconds": 80.911,
    "end_seconds": 85.349,
    "text": "of atomic nuclei and electrons and intense light."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.916",
    "end": "00:01:31.589",
    "start_seconds": 85.916,
    "end_seconds": 91.589,
    "text": "That light, on its way to us, has crossed an expanding universe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.956",
    "end": "00:01:35.659",
    "start_seconds": 91.956,
    "end_seconds": 95.65899999999999,
    "text": "That expansion not only carried those regions far away from us,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.659",
    "end": "00:01:40.698",
    "start_seconds": 95.65899999999999,
    "end_seconds": 100.69800000000001,
    "text": "but also as the light waves crossed an expanding space,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.731",
    "end": "00:01:44.135",
    "start_seconds": 100.731,
    "end_seconds": 104.13499999999999,
    "text": "they were stretched from micron-sized waves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.168",
    "end": "00:01:47.438",
    "start_seconds": 104.168,
    "end_seconds": 107.438,
    "text": "to millimeter-sized waves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.738",
    "end": "00:01:51.475",
    "start_seconds": 107.738,
    "end_seconds": 111.475,
    "text": "So although it is light that leaves the young universe,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.509",
    "end": "00:01:54.078",
    "start_seconds": 111.509,
    "end_seconds": 114.078,
    "text": "it’s microwaves that arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.578",
    "end": "00:01:58.015",
    "start_seconds": 114.578,
    "end_seconds": 118.015,
    "text": "And they are the famous cosmic microwave background."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.716",
    "end": "00:02:01.886",
    "start_seconds": 118.71600000000001,
    "end_seconds": 121.886,
    "text": "Now because every direction in which you look"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.919",
    "end": "00:02:04.388",
    "start_seconds": 121.919,
    "end_seconds": 124.388,
    "text": "ends back in the young universe,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.388",
    "end": "00:02:08.893",
    "start_seconds": 124.388,
    "end_seconds": 128.893,
    "text": "then the microwave radiation comes to us from all directions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.926",
    "end": "00:02:10.094",
    "start_seconds": 128.926,
    "end_seconds": 130.094,
    "text": "and for many years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.127",
    "end": "00:02:13.297",
    "start_seconds": 130.127,
    "end_seconds": 133.297,
    "text": "its brightness was thought to be extremely uniform,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.330",
    "end": "00:02:16.333",
    "start_seconds": 133.33,
    "end_seconds": 136.333,
    "text": "around the full spherical dome of the sky,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.367",
    "end": "00:02:18.536",
    "start_seconds": 136.367,
    "end_seconds": 138.536,
    "text": "[a] bit like this image here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.569",
    "end": "00:02:22.072",
    "start_seconds": 138.569,
    "end_seconds": 142.072,
    "text": "But as microwave telescopes became more sensitive,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.106",
    "end": "00:02:26.644",
    "start_seconds": 142.106,
    "end_seconds": 146.644,
    "text": "they began to see slight variations in brightness from place to place,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.677",
    "end": "00:02:30.281",
    "start_seconds": 146.677,
    "end_seconds": 150.281,
    "text": "so more recent images of the microwave sky"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.314",
    "end": "00:02:34.084",
    "start_seconds": 150.314,
    "end_seconds": 154.084,
    "text": "appear completely covered in very slight patches."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.718",
    "end": "00:02:36.120",
    "start_seconds": 154.71800000000002,
    "end_seconds": 156.12,
    "text": "You can see them more clearly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.153",
    "end": "00:02:39.657",
    "start_seconds": 156.153,
    "end_seconds": 159.65699999999998,
    "text": "in this blowup of a region that's about the size of your fist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.690",
    "end": "00:02:41.292",
    "start_seconds": 159.69,
    "end_seconds": 161.292,
    "text": "held at arm's length."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.692",
    "end": "00:02:46.263",
    "start_seconds": 161.692,
    "end_seconds": 166.263,
    "text": "It spans eight million light-years and shows us the newborn universe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.297",
    "end": "00:02:49.466",
    "start_seconds": 166.297,
    "end_seconds": 169.466,
    "text": "when it was only 400,000 years old."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.500",
    "end": "00:02:53.704",
    "start_seconds": 169.5,
    "end_seconds": 173.704,
    "text": "Now that's equivalent to a one-day-old human."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.205",
    "end": "00:02:56.307",
    "start_seconds": 174.20499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 176.30700000000002,
    "text": "So what are these patches?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.340",
    "end": "00:03:00.244",
    "start_seconds": 176.34,
    "end_seconds": 180.244,
    "text": "Why is it slightly brighter and darker in different places?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.644",
    "end": "00:03:02.913",
    "start_seconds": 180.644,
    "end_seconds": 182.913,
    "text": "Well, these are places where the temperature"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.947",
    "end": "00:03:07.117",
    "start_seconds": 182.947,
    "end_seconds": 187.117,
    "text": "and pressure in the glowing gas are slightly higher and slightly lower,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.117",
    "end": "00:03:08.519",
    "start_seconds": 187.117,
    "end_seconds": 188.519,
    "text": "or stated differently,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.552",
    "end": "00:03:11.555",
    "start_seconds": 188.552,
    "end_seconds": 191.555,
    "text": "the bright and dark patches are the peaks and troughs"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.555",
    "end": "00:03:13.290",
    "start_seconds": 191.555,
    "end_seconds": 193.29,
    "text": "of huge sound waves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.324",
    "end": "00:03:16.060",
    "start_seconds": 193.324,
    "end_seconds": 196.06,
    "text": "moving through the primordial atmosphere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.460",
    "end": "00:03:19.763",
    "start_seconds": 196.46,
    "end_seconds": 199.763,
    "text": "The brightness contrast reveals 90 decibels --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.797",
    "end": "00:03:22.466",
    "start_seconds": 199.797,
    "end_seconds": 202.466,
    "text": "that's rock-concert loudness,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.466",
    "end": "00:03:26.303",
    "start_seconds": 202.466,
    "end_seconds": 206.303,
    "text": "and their gigantic size reveals a frequency or pitch,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.337",
    "end": "00:03:30.541",
    "start_seconds": 206.337,
    "end_seconds": 210.541,
    "text": "a whopping 50 octaves below the human range."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.008",
    "end": "00:03:36.046",
    "start_seconds": 211.008,
    "end_seconds": 216.046,
    "text": "One wave might pass you by in 50,000 years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.547",
    "end": "00:03:39.250",
    "start_seconds": 216.547,
    "end_seconds": 219.25,
    "text": "So what causes this sound?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.283",
    "end": "00:03:41.352",
    "start_seconds": 219.28300000000002,
    "end_seconds": 221.352,
    "text": "Now don’t be fooled."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.385",
    "end": "00:03:44.154",
    "start_seconds": 221.385,
    "end_seconds": 224.154,
    "text": "It's not the bang of the Big Bang."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.188",
    "end": "00:03:48.325",
    "start_seconds": 224.188,
    "end_seconds": 228.325,
    "text": "No, it's a slowly growing sound driven by gravity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.892",
    "end": "00:03:52.463",
    "start_seconds": 228.892,
    "end_seconds": 232.463,
    "text": "The distribution of matter at that time was slightly uneven,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.496",
    "end": "00:03:54.231",
    "start_seconds": 232.496,
    "end_seconds": 234.231,
    "text": "and where there was a denser region,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.231",
    "end": "00:03:57.034",
    "start_seconds": 234.231,
    "end_seconds": 237.034,
    "text": "its stronger gravity pulled in the surrounding gas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.067",
    "end": "00:03:59.503",
    "start_seconds": 237.067,
    "end_seconds": 239.503,
    "text": "which compressed and bounced back out again,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.536",
    "end": "00:04:01.805",
    "start_seconds": 239.536,
    "end_seconds": 241.805,
    "text": "only to fall back in again,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.839",
    "end": "00:04:05.442",
    "start_seconds": 241.839,
    "end_seconds": 245.442,
    "text": "creating an approximately spherical sound wave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.843",
    "end": "00:04:09.513",
    "start_seconds": 245.843,
    "end_seconds": 249.513,
    "text": "Now the landscape included small and medium and large regions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.513",
    "end": "00:04:13.317",
    "start_seconds": 249.513,
    "end_seconds": 253.317,
    "text": "and so, a bit like a set of organ pipes of different sizes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.350",
    "end": "00:04:16.787",
    "start_seconds": 253.35,
    "end_seconds": 256.787,
    "text": "Together, they create a wide range of pitch."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.087",
    "end": "00:04:20.724",
    "start_seconds": 257.087,
    "end_seconds": 260.724,
    "text": "So what did the primordial sound sound like?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.358",
    "end": "00:04:24.895",
    "start_seconds": 261.358,
    "end_seconds": 264.895,
    "text": "Well to find out, you must first measure the sounds spectrum."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.396",
    "end": "00:04:27.131",
    "start_seconds": 265.396,
    "end_seconds": 267.131,
    "text": "Now a computer can do that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.164",
    "end": "00:04:29.566",
    "start_seconds": 267.164,
    "end_seconds": 269.566,
    "text": "And here is the remarkable result."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.600",
    "end": "00:04:34.104",
    "start_seconds": 269.6,
    "end_seconds": 274.104,
    "text": "There is a fundamental tone and several higher harmonics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.104",
    "end": "00:04:35.873",
    "start_seconds": 274.104,
    "end_seconds": 275.873,
    "text": "And just for comparison,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.906",
    "end": "00:04:39.677",
    "start_seconds": 275.906,
    "end_seconds": 279.677,
    "text": "here is the sound spectrum of a flute playing a single note"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.677",
    "end": "00:04:42.579",
    "start_seconds": 279.677,
    "end_seconds": 282.579,
    "text": "with its fundamental and harmonics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.180",
    "end": "00:04:48.218",
    "start_seconds": 283.18,
    "end_seconds": 288.218,
    "text": "Now although these two sets of harmonics arise for somewhat different reasons,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.252",
    "end": "00:04:52.222",
    "start_seconds": 288.252,
    "end_seconds": 292.222,
    "text": "nevertheless, it does seem that the young universe had qualities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.256",
    "end": "00:04:57.494",
    "start_seconds": 292.256,
    "end_seconds": 297.494,
    "text": "similar to a musical instrument or even a human voice singing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.528",
    "end": "00:05:01.498",
    "start_seconds": 297.528,
    "end_seconds": 301.498,
    "text": "But notice how those cosmic harmonics are a little bit broad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.932",
    "end": "00:05:06.570",
    "start_seconds": 301.932,
    "end_seconds": 306.57,
    "text": "So please don't expect the primordial sound to be too clean"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.603",
    "end": "00:05:09.239",
    "start_seconds": 306.603,
    "end_seconds": 309.239,
    "text": "or musical to your human ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.707",
    "end": "00:05:11.308",
    "start_seconds": 309.707,
    "end_seconds": 311.308,
    "text": "Now before I play you the sound,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.308",
    "end": "00:05:15.112",
    "start_seconds": 311.308,
    "end_seconds": 315.112,
    "text": "take a look at that green line that goes right through all the data."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.145",
    "end": "00:05:17.614",
    "start_seconds": 315.145,
    "end_seconds": 317.614,
    "text": "It comes from a detailed computer calculation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.648",
    "end": "00:05:20.017",
    "start_seconds": 317.648,
    "end_seconds": 320.017,
    "text": "that aims to include all the relevant physics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.351",
    "end": "00:05:23.120",
    "start_seconds": 320.351,
    "end_seconds": 323.12,
    "text": "The fit is amazingly good"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.787",
    "end": "00:05:29.226",
    "start_seconds": 323.787,
    "end_seconds": 329.226,
    "text": "and shows that we really do understand what’s happening in the young universe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.660",
    "end": "00:05:33.864",
    "start_seconds": 329.66,
    "end_seconds": 333.864,
    "text": "In fact, the task of matching those computer calculations to the data"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.897",
    "end": "00:05:38.502",
    "start_seconds": 333.897,
    "end_seconds": 338.502,
    "text": "basically measures quite accurately many of the fundamental properties"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.535",
    "end": "00:05:40.037",
    "start_seconds": 338.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 340.037,
    "text": "of our universe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.604",
    "end": "00:05:45.676",
    "start_seconds": 340.604,
    "end_seconds": 345.676,
    "text": "OK, let's now listen to the sound after up-shifting by 50 octaves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.709",
    "end": "00:05:47.111",
    "start_seconds": 345.709,
    "end_seconds": 347.111,
    "text": "so that we can hear it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.544",
    "end": "00:05:50.080",
    "start_seconds": 347.544,
    "end_seconds": 350.08,
    "text": "Now I’ve also used those computer calculations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.114",
    "end": "00:05:52.816",
    "start_seconds": 350.114,
    "end_seconds": 352.81600000000003,
    "text": "to track the sound forward in time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.850",
    "end": "00:05:56.720",
    "start_seconds": 352.85,
    "end_seconds": 356.72,
    "text": "starting at the Big Bang and spanning the full acoustic era,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.720",
    "end": "00:05:59.490",
    "start_seconds": 356.72,
    "end_seconds": 359.49,
    "text": "which ends at 400,000 years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.990",
    "end": "00:06:04.895",
    "start_seconds": 359.99,
    "end_seconds": 364.895,
    "text": "The sound is accompanied by a graphic that's a bit busy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.895",
    "end": "00:06:07.030",
    "start_seconds": 364.895,
    "end_seconds": 367.03,
    "text": "but just focus on the green line,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.030",
    "end": "00:06:09.533",
    "start_seconds": 367.03,
    "end_seconds": 369.533,
    "text": "which tracks the changing harmonics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.566",
    "end": "00:06:13.337",
    "start_seconds": 369.566,
    "end_seconds": 373.337,
    "text": "as the young universe begins to expand and age."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.637",
    "end": "00:06:15.939",
    "start_seconds": 373.637,
    "end_seconds": 375.939,
    "text": "Also, don't worry,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.939",
    "end": "00:06:20.711",
    "start_seconds": 375.939,
    "end_seconds": 380.711,
    "text": "I’ve compressed those 400,000 years into just 10 seconds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.744",
    "end": "00:06:22.045",
    "start_seconds": 380.744,
    "end_seconds": 382.045,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.079",
    "end": "00:06:23.280",
    "start_seconds": 382.079,
    "end_seconds": 383.28,
    "text": "Here we go."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.925",
    "end": "00:06:36.093",
    "start_seconds": 394.925,
    "end_seconds": 396.093,
    "text": "OK, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:36.093",
    "end": "00:06:39.763",
    "start_seconds": 396.093,
    "end_seconds": 399.763,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.598",
    "end": "00:06:46.170",
    "start_seconds": 401.598,
    "end_seconds": 406.17,
    "text": "If you weren't quite awake before that, you are now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.370",
    "end": "00:06:48.005",
    "start_seconds": 406.37,
    "end_seconds": 408.005,
    "text": "Well as I warned you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.038",
    "end": "00:06:51.708",
    "start_seconds": 408.038,
    "end_seconds": 411.70799999999997,
    "text": "those broad harmonics make a sound that's more like noise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.708",
    "end": "00:06:53.177",
    "start_seconds": 411.70799999999997,
    "end_seconds": 413.177,
    "text": "than music to our ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.177",
    "end": "00:06:55.345",
    "start_seconds": 413.177,
    "end_seconds": 415.345,
    "text": "And I'll return to that in just a minute."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.345",
    "end": "00:06:57.815",
    "start_seconds": 415.345,
    "end_seconds": 417.815,
    "text": "You obviously noticed the drop in pitch,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.815",
    "end": "00:06:59.483",
    "start_seconds": 417.815,
    "end_seconds": 419.483,
    "text": "and that's because as time passes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.516",
    "end": "00:07:03.220",
    "start_seconds": 419.516,
    "end_seconds": 423.22,
    "text": "larger and larger regions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.220",
    "end": "00:07:04.888",
    "start_seconds": 423.22,
    "end_seconds": 424.888,
    "text": "larger organ pipes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.888",
    "end": "00:07:06.723",
    "start_seconds": 424.888,
    "end_seconds": 426.723,
    "text": "have had time to start sounding."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:06.723",
    "end": "00:07:08.992",
    "start_seconds": 426.723,
    "end_seconds": 428.992,
    "text": "And as their larger waves get included,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.026",
    "end": "00:07:11.628",
    "start_seconds": 429.026,
    "end_seconds": 431.628,
    "text": "also the overall pitch drops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.830",
    "end": "00:07:15.432",
    "start_seconds": 432.83,
    "end_seconds": 435.432,
    "text": "Now you might wonder whether"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.300",
    "end": "00:07:19.937",
    "start_seconds": 436.3,
    "end_seconds": 439.937,
    "text": "this wonderful acoustic period back in the universe’s youth"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.937",
    "end": "00:07:25.309",
    "start_seconds": 439.937,
    "end_seconds": 445.309,
    "text": "left any traces in today's old universe filled with galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.442",
    "end": "00:07:27.911",
    "start_seconds": 445.442,
    "end_seconds": 447.911,
    "text": "And the answer is yes, it has."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:27.911",
    "end": "00:07:29.313",
    "start_seconds": 447.911,
    "end_seconds": 449.313,
    "text": "And here's why."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.313",
    "end": "00:07:30.581",
    "start_seconds": 449.313,
    "end_seconds": 450.581,
    "text": "At 400,000 years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.614",
    "end": "00:07:33.984",
    "start_seconds": 450.614,
    "end_seconds": 453.984,
    "text": "the cooling universe suddenly turned transparent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.984",
    "end": "00:07:37.988",
    "start_seconds": 453.984,
    "end_seconds": 457.988,
    "text": "The sound waves ceased oscillating and froze in place,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.988",
    "end": "00:07:41.658",
    "start_seconds": 457.988,
    "end_seconds": 461.658,
    "text": "and the matter began to collapse under its own gravity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.692",
    "end": "00:07:44.962",
    "start_seconds": 461.692,
    "end_seconds": 464.962,
    "text": "to make first stars and then galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.262",
    "end": "00:07:48.298",
    "start_seconds": 465.262,
    "end_seconds": 468.298,
    "text": "Now here's a map of today's old universe,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.398",
    "end": "00:07:51.301",
    "start_seconds": 468.398,
    "end_seconds": 471.301,
    "text": "spanning four billion light-years, with us at the center."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.335",
    "end": "00:07:55.305",
    "start_seconds": 471.335,
    "end_seconds": 475.305,
    "text": "And it shows the positions of about 100,000 galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.672",
    "end": "00:07:58.876",
    "start_seconds": 475.672,
    "end_seconds": 478.876,
    "text": "And if you perform a similar wave analysis,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.942",
    "end": "00:08:01.812",
    "start_seconds": 478.942,
    "end_seconds": 481.812,
    "text": "sure enough, there's the fundamental and harmonics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.812",
    "end": "00:08:04.815",
    "start_seconds": 481.812,
    "end_seconds": 484.815,
    "text": "showing up faintly in those web-like patterns."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.815",
    "end": "00:08:09.353",
    "start_seconds": 484.815,
    "end_seconds": 489.353,
    "text": "The sound waves have turned to stone, so to speak,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.353",
    "end": "00:08:13.056",
    "start_seconds": 489.353,
    "end_seconds": 493.056,
    "text": "and become fossilized in the patterns of galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.457",
    "end": "00:08:15.792",
    "start_seconds": 493.457,
    "end_seconds": 495.792,
    "text": "But even more remarkable, I think,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.792",
    "end": "00:08:19.897",
    "start_seconds": 495.792,
    "end_seconds": 499.897,
    "text": "is that we think all of this cosmic structure,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:19.897",
    "end": "00:08:22.032",
    "start_seconds": 499.897,
    "end_seconds": 502.032,
    "text": "the sound waves and the galaxy patterns,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.132",
    "end": "00:08:24.268",
    "start_seconds": 502.132,
    "end_seconds": 504.26800000000003,
    "text": "had their ultimate cause"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.268",
    "end": "00:08:29.940",
    "start_seconds": 504.26800000000003,
    "end_seconds": 509.94,
    "text": "with subatomic quantum vibrations during the universe's birth process."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.107",
    "end": "00:08:33.577",
    "start_seconds": 510.10699999999997,
    "end_seconds": 513.577,
    "text": "An incredibly short time of hyperexpansion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:33.644",
    "end": "00:08:35.012",
    "start_seconds": 513.644,
    "end_seconds": 515.012,
    "text": "that we call inflation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:35.445",
    "end": "00:08:38.515",
    "start_seconds": 515.445,
    "end_seconds": 518.515,
    "text": "Now this is a truly stunning proposition."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.116",
    "end": "00:08:42.653",
    "start_seconds": 519.116,
    "end_seconds": 522.653,
    "text": "That quantum oscillations smaller than atoms"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.753",
    "end": "00:08:44.955",
    "start_seconds": 522.753,
    "end_seconds": 524.955,
    "text": "get amplified by cosmic expansion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:45.222",
    "end": "00:08:47.791",
    "start_seconds": 525.222,
    "end_seconds": 527.7909999999999,
    "text": "to make huge sound waves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.791",
    "end": "00:08:51.361",
    "start_seconds": 527.7909999999999,
    "end_seconds": 531.361,
    "text": "that then transform"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:51.361",
    "end": "00:08:54.898",
    "start_seconds": 531.361,
    "end_seconds": 534.898,
    "text": "into an ever-expanding tapestry of galaxies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:54.898",
    "end": "00:08:56.934",
    "start_seconds": 534.898,
    "end_seconds": 536.934,
    "text": "It's a direct connection"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.934",
    "end": "00:08:59.937",
    "start_seconds": 536.934,
    "end_seconds": 539.937,
    "text": "between the quantum world and the cosmic world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:01.605",
    "end": "00:09:05.876",
    "start_seconds": 541.605,
    "end_seconds": 545.876,
    "text": "Well lastly, I wanted to introduce a project"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.876",
    "end": "00:09:09.546",
    "start_seconds": 545.876,
    "end_seconds": 549.546,
    "text": "that brings this primordial sound and its changing harmonics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.147",
    "end": "00:09:13.317",
    "start_seconds": 550.147,
    "end_seconds": 553.317,
    "text": "into our own human musical world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:13.417",
    "end": "00:09:17.788",
    "start_seconds": 553.417,
    "end_seconds": 557.788,
    "text": "And so after up-shifting by 50 octaves,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:17.821",
    "end": "00:09:22.559",
    "start_seconds": 557.821,
    "end_seconds": 562.559,
    "text": "I timed when the pitch of each harmonic matched the pitch of each note"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.859",
    "end": "00:09:26.129",
    "start_seconds": 562.859,
    "end_seconds": 566.129,
    "text": "on a simple piano keyboard,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.129",
    "end": "00:09:28.665",
    "start_seconds": 566.129,
    "end_seconds": 568.665,
    "text": "and you can see the notes here, descending over time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:28.665",
    "end": "00:09:33.003",
    "start_seconds": 568.665,
    "end_seconds": 573.003,
    "text": "Now this modifies the sound in two important ways."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.003",
    "end": "00:09:36.406",
    "start_seconds": 573.003,
    "end_seconds": 576.406,
    "text": "It narrows those broad, noise-like harmonics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:36.406",
    "end": "00:09:38.575",
    "start_seconds": 576.406,
    "end_seconds": 578.575,
    "text": "into single musical notes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:38.675",
    "end": "00:09:43.213",
    "start_seconds": 578.675,
    "end_seconds": 583.213,
    "text": "And secondly, those notes get sounded at particular times."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:43.246",
    "end": "00:09:47.985",
    "start_seconds": 583.246,
    "end_seconds": 587.985,
    "text": "So overall, the sound takes on a more melodic and rhythmic character."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:48.452",
    "end": "00:09:51.521",
    "start_seconds": 588.452,
    "end_seconds": 591.521,
    "text": "So here's a brief sonification of these notes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:51.688",
    "end": "00:09:57.260",
    "start_seconds": 591.688,
    "end_seconds": 597.26,
    "text": "for a period lasting 150,000 years, compressed to 10 seconds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:57.260",
    "end": "00:10:01.932",
    "start_seconds": 597.26,
    "end_seconds": 601.932,
    "text": "[Cosmic harmonics]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:08.672",
    "end": "00:10:09.840",
    "start_seconds": 608.672,
    "end_seconds": 609.84,
    "text": "OK, thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:09.840",
    "end": "00:10:11.908",
    "start_seconds": 609.84,
    "end_seconds": 611.908,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:13.210",
    "end": "00:10:17.147",
    "start_seconds": 613.21,
    "end_seconds": 617.147,
    "text": "To finally add artistic expression to this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:17.147",
    "end": "00:10:22.119",
    "start_seconds": 617.147,
    "end_seconds": 622.119,
    "text": "I gave these notes to sound artist Ander Mikalson,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.119",
    "end": "00:10:26.123",
    "start_seconds": 622.119,
    "end_seconds": 626.123,
    "text": "who worked with Pulitzer Prize-winning composer Caroline Shaw"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.123",
    "end": "00:10:29.860",
    "start_seconds": 626.123,
    "end_seconds": 629.86,
    "text": "to write a work for choir and organ, lasting about 10 minutes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:29.860",
    "end": "00:10:32.229",
    "start_seconds": 629.86,
    "end_seconds": 632.229,
    "text": "and based on these note sequences."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:32.729",
    "end": "00:10:35.932",
    "start_seconds": 632.729,
    "end_seconds": 635.932,
    "text": "It's been performed a number of times,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:35.932",
    "end": "00:10:39.503",
    "start_seconds": 635.932,
    "end_seconds": 639.503,
    "text": "but here's a brief excerpt from a performance in the Catholic Cathedral"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:39.503",
    "end": "00:10:40.637",
    "start_seconds": 639.503,
    "end_seconds": 640.637,
    "text": "in Richmond, Virginia."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:40.637",
    "end": "00:10:44.474",
    "start_seconds": 640.637,
    "end_seconds": 644.474,
    "text": "[Music]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:00.791",
    "end": "00:11:05.062",
    "start_seconds": 660.791,
    "end_seconds": 665.062,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:09.166",
    "end": "00:11:11.868",
    "start_seconds": 669.166,
    "end_seconds": 671.868,
    "text": "I think this is one of the few times"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:11.868",
    "end": "00:11:14.204",
    "start_seconds": 671.868,
    "end_seconds": 674.204,
    "text": "I've experienced a genuine coming together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:14.204",
    "end": "00:11:16.540",
    "start_seconds": 674.204,
    "end_seconds": 676.54,
    "text": "of science and art,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:16.573",
    "end": "00:11:20.043",
    "start_seconds": 676.573,
    "end_seconds": 680.043,
    "text": "both framed within a sacred context."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:20.043",
    "end": "00:11:23.246",
    "start_seconds": 680.043,
    "end_seconds": 683.246,
    "text": "It was a moment to feel deeply connected to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:23.246",
    "end": "00:11:25.949",
    "start_seconds": 683.246,
    "end_seconds": 685.949,
    "text": "and part of the entire universe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:27.117",
    "end": "00:11:31.421",
    "start_seconds": 687.117,
    "end_seconds": 691.421,
    "text": "Those particles and atoms from that first acoustic era"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:31.421",
    "end": "00:11:33.824",
    "start_seconds": 691.421,
    "end_seconds": 693.824,
    "text": "went on to make stars"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:33.824",
    "end": "00:11:36.660",
    "start_seconds": 693.824,
    "end_seconds": 696.66,
    "text": "and galaxies and planets and, of course, us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:36.660",
    "end": "00:11:39.396",
    "start_seconds": 696.66,
    "end_seconds": 699.396,
    "text": "And right now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:39.396",
    "end": "00:11:41.798",
    "start_seconds": 699.396,
    "end_seconds": 701.798,
    "text": "some of those atoms are inside your brain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:41.798",
    "end": "00:11:48.271",
    "start_seconds": 701.798,
    "end_seconds": 708.271,
    "text": "somehow witnessing and understanding their own ancestry."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:48.271",
    "end": "00:11:51.274",
    "start_seconds": 708.271,
    "end_seconds": 711.274,
    "text": "They were out in that hot, glowing gas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:51.341",
    "end": "00:11:53.977",
    "start_seconds": 711.341,
    "end_seconds": 713.977,
    "text": "participating in that first symphony."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:53.977",
    "end": "00:11:59.382",
    "start_seconds": 713.977,
    "end_seconds": 719.382,
    "text": "Nowhere else, as far as we know, can the universe appreciate itself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:59.382",
    "end": "00:12:03.553",
    "start_seconds": 719.382,
    "end_seconds": 723.553,
    "text": "The stars and galaxies are not themselves sentient,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:03.687",
    "end": "00:12:04.821",
    "start_seconds": 723.687,
    "end_seconds": 724.821,
    "text": "but we are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:05.222",
    "end": "00:12:09.126",
    "start_seconds": 725.222,
    "end_seconds": 729.126,
    "text": "We are an exceedingly rare part of the universe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:09.493",
    "end": "00:12:13.930",
    "start_seconds": 729.493,
    "end_seconds": 733.93,
    "text": "Perhaps the only part through which the universe can witness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:13.930",
    "end": "00:12:15.732",
    "start_seconds": 733.93,
    "end_seconds": 735.732,
    "text": "and understand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:15.732",
    "end": "00:12:18.368",
    "start_seconds": 735.732,
    "end_seconds": 738.368,
    "text": "and marvel at itself."
  },
  {
